 .../RenderDll/Common/RendererCVars.h          |  1 +
 .../GraphicsPipeline/SceneReferredExport.cpp  | 29 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../CinematicCamera/docs/ConsoleReference.md  | 13 +++++++--
 4 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

